OL,3,GNEWSABig dogs face longer wait for
OL,4,Ahomes, charities say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnimal rescue centres across the
OL,7,Fsouth-west of England say large dogs
OL,8,Fare now waiting longer to find new
OL,9,Fhomes.
OL,11,FWoodside Animal Sanctuary in Plymouth
OL,12,Fsaid its kennels were full as well as a
OL,13,Fwaitlist of more than 40 large dogs. It
OL,14,Fsaid the cost of owning a bigger dog
OL,15,Fput some people off, while many larger
OL,16,Fanimals needed extra training before
OL,17,Fthey could be rehomed.
OL,19,FThe RSPCA Cornwall Animal Centre said
OL,20,Fbig dogs in its care now waited an
OL,21,Faverage of six months or more to find a
OL,22,Fnew home.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
